Package: gps-station
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), gpsd
Recommends: ntpsec, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-notify-0.7, zenity
Description: GPS time for ntpsec and grid square for the sBitx/zBitx
 Watches gpsd on an sBitx or zBitx transceiver. Once the GPS has a fix it
 adds the GPS as a refclock to ntpsec, calibrates its NMEA delay against
 network time when the network is up, and sets the radio's grid square
 (Maidenhead locator) in the sbitx or zbitxre software over its TCP port.
 .
 On the desktop, a tray icon finds running WSJT-X, JTDX, JS8Call, fldigi,
 QSSTV and GridTracker, shows whether each one's grid square matches the
 GPS, and updates the ones you tick that can be changed while running.
